jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building the next chapter of AI-native craft and creativity - where craft and technology meet. Our unified platform bridges the gap between AI capabilities and human creativity, and lets professional creatives and designers harness the power of the world’s leading AI models without losing precision, expression, or soul. Together, we’re building tools that help people move faster without sacrificing quality, precision, or craft — a platform where AI supports creativity instead of flattening it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Figma-Weave designers are highly collaborative self-starters who push their teams to build amazing experiences for all our users. We have a diverse range of experiences and expertise and love learning from each other. Our designers thrive on solving hard problems, considering every detail, and achieving ambitious goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Product Designer to join Figma Weave, this role sits at the intersection of generative AI, node-based workflow editing, and creative tools, building a platform that makes sophisticated AI generation accessible through visual workflows. You&#39;ll work directly with our founding team to drive critical initiatives - from our workflow editor, to team collaboration features, to strategic integrations with Figma. This is a rare opportunity to join at the ground floor where you&#39;ll have outsized impact on product direction and help define how creators interact with cutting-edge generative AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you’ll do at Figma Weave:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall strategy and decision-making about product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver clear storytelling around customer needs and business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product management, engineering, and design peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, collaborate, and iterate on flows, prototypes, and high-fidelity visuals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship high-quality features and product improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a mentor and provide thoughtful feedback to your peers (and benefit from strong personal and professional mentorship opportunities yourself!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working as a product designer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience working on a software product with similar scale or complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using node-based design tools or broader design/ development tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills; you’re able to explain your design decisions and strategy with clear rationale and storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great attention to detail, and an eye for visual craft, such as composition, typography, and layout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with technical things like HTML/CSS, prototyping tools such as Origami, or advanced Figma features like Auto Layout, Variables, and Components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past experience designing for developers, or partnering closely with developing on complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A design/development hybrid background, or experience building websites or apps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of working on canvas-based interfaces or tools that support creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations-ext@figma.com&quot;&gt;accommodations-ext@figma.com&lt;/a&gt;. These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application limits:&lt;/strong&gt; To help candidates focus on the opportunities most relevant to their skills and experience, Figma limits the number and frequency of applications. These limits apply to all roles:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may submit up to 5 applications during any rolling 30-day period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Design team at Raisin brings together product designers and brand &amp;amp; marketing designers; we are united by our shared belief in the power of respect, creativity, and the purpose to give people financial peace of mind. We’ve built a place where empathy and innovation thrive, where integrity and high quality standards underpin our work. We love our diversity and use the strength of our perspectives to reach our goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build with heart to create solutions that empower users, shake up industries, and leave a lasting mark, all while working to make Raisin a leader in our field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create desirable, usable digital products and features:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design activities to launch and improve features that help customers explore and manage their portfolio or products and services offered by Raisin -&amp;nbsp; and confidently move from information to action - across app, web, and email.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify&amp;nbsp; places where AI can simplify complex financial journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead rapid prototyping activities. Use generative and agentic tools to turn bold concepts into something people can try and share feedback on.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead - with Product Managers and Engineers -&amp;nbsp; larger end-to-end design discovery and delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hold the bar on quality and ethical guardrails:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make quality a habit: validate quickly, and iterate. Use qualitative research, flow analytics, industry best practices, operational metrics, and security and compliance feedback to keep UX guardrails clear and real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support final delivery - working side-by-side with engineering team to keep the final work true to its original design intent, and manifestation. Own design QA checks, and support implementation by contributing to-be-reviewed code (through agentic tools) for the small things that make the experience better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run feedback loops so AI-generated work meets a high ethical and quality standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across functions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team-up&amp;nbsp; with product managers, engineers, and data specialists to design and ship high-quality experiences. Be proactive in the way you work together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spar with other designers - within and outside your tribe - to review and ideate solutions you propose - in order to create consistency across different parts of the experience.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your depth of knowledge of customer expectations, behaviors (with support of emerging AI capabilities) to work with product managers - in order to define strategic goals and critical hypotheses of what makes a highly desirable, usable, and trustworthy product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with peers, engineers, and data specialists to experiment and to put in place the UX infrastructure for AI-driven features. Co-create products that are personal and highly secure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tell a clear story. Explain your design intent, choices, and trade-offs to team and stakeholders. Ask for feedback, and give it clearly and openly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn technical and compliance requirements into usable experiences:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex backend and platform capabilities, including AI/ML models and agentic logic, into interfaces that customers and internal teams can easily use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface compliance requirements, and use them to shape experiences that are robust and friendly at the same time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to a living design system:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt reusable, flexible UX patterns, and add new ones when needed, so we make micro-frontends look - and feel - cohesive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the team responsible for the Raisin Design System, so components and patterns stay accessible, consistent and well documented across platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help the live design system grow: contribute spec-to-code delivery of components and scalable UX patterns when they support the features, services, and experiences you are designing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay curious, and keep experimenting:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolving practices and principles of the overall Raisin Design team, by owning definition of specific design and validation approaches, tooling, workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep your craft fresh. Stay current on AI capabilities and on how design work changes when agents are in the loop, so Raisin’s design practice stays sharp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in product design, ideally within fintech, digital brokerage, or other highly regulated, complex environments (e.g., healthtech, legaltech, or high-stakes SaaS) where designing for trust, long-term user decisions, and compliance is critical. Experience in complex e-commerce offerings may also be beneficial to help customers understand a faceted product offering and non-linear decision-making.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that shows strong product design experience in complex products and systems: user-centered methods, and real examples of AI/ML-driven features, agentic workflows, or conversational interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of AI UX design paradigms, specifically how to design for system uncertainty, predictability, user trust, error prevention, and &quot;human-in-the-loop&quot; feedback mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in various user-driven validation techniques, including qualitative, quantitative, and analytics-based approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced with prototyping using Generative and Agentic tools to accelerate concept exploration and build high-fidelity work - for both discovery and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of execution and delivery processes, including project management and resource allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident facilitating cross-functional workshops and aligning engineering-heavy stakeholders, including business owners, product managers, developers, data scientists and AI/ML engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-informed mindset, comfortable working with security, compliance, operational KPIs, and AI system metrics (such as model accuracy, latency, and user feedback loops)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mastery of storytelling techniques to engage stakeholders and users throughout the design process, including explaining complex AI logic or automated systems in simple, human terms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, continuous learner who actively integrates AI-augmented workflows (e.g., for research synthesis, copywriting, ideation, delivery) to optimize personal design velocity and output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Catawiki as a &lt;em&gt;UX Designer&lt;/em&gt; shaping the experience of buying and selling special objects, from discovery through to the experience after a sale. This role is not tied to a single product vertical: its scope can sit within Demand (buyer-side features), Supply (seller-side features) or Fulfilment (post-sale experiences, including payments, shipping and customer service).&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll bring a connected view of the marketplace to your product area, understanding how buyer, seller and post-sale experiences influence one another. You&#39;ll identify where people need support and where design can make the greatest difference, balancing customer needs, business goals and technical constraints. You&#39;ll lead through your work and influence, rather than people management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design for parts of the seller and expert experience, from research and early concepts through prototyping, delivery and learning after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer research, behavioural data and business insight to frame problems, identify needs and prioritise design opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn complex problems into clear journeys, interaction and interface designs, prototypes and service flows. Test ideas with customers and colleagues, and use what you learn to improve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Managers, Engineers, Data Scientists, UX Writers, supply stakeholders and other designers to shape and deliver solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance user empathy with business goals and technical constraints, connecting your design decisions to measurable customer and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to design systems and shared patterns that create coherent experiences across Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Figma and practical AI-assisted workflows to explore ideas and build prototypes, applying judgment to the outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate your thinking clearly, tell the story behind your decisions and iterate in response to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguity and competing priorities, getting up to speed quickly with the aim of contributing productively within your first month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of experience owning UX or product design work end to end&lt;/strong&gt;, with a portfolio showing how you approached complex problems, the decisions you made and the outcomes you contributed to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong interaction design, prototyping and visual communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with an understanding of how to use and improve design systems and shared patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience conducting or contributing to customer research and translating research&lt;/strong&gt;, data and direct feedback into design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Figma skills and practical experience using AI for design ideation or prototyping&lt;/strong&gt;, alongside a willingness to keep experimenting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear, structured communication in English&lt;/strong&gt; and the ability to explain your approach to design and non-design partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured problem solving, independent decision-making and systems thinking&lt;/strong&gt;: understanding how decisions within one product area affect connected journeys and the wider marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ability to manage stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;, collaborate across disciplines and influence decisions without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability and openness to feedback as priorities&lt;/strong&gt;, processes and design tools evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Helpful experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working in a smaller product company, e-commerce platform or marketplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing seller journeys or working on marketplace experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering in less structured environments with several competing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Across disciplines&lt;/span&gt;: You&#39;ll work closely with Product Managers, Engineers, Data Scientists, UX Writers, supply stakeholders and other designers, bringing customer needs, business goals and technical constraints into shared decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;From evidence to iteration&lt;/span&gt;: Customer research, behavioural data and direct feedback help shape the work. You&#39;ll explore and test ideas, iterate with customers and colleagues, and keep learning after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;With ownership and openness&lt;/span&gt;: You&#39;ll own design decisions, explain your rationale and bring feedback into the process. Clear communication and influence matter more than formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;With shared patterns and practical tools&lt;/span&gt;: We use Figma, design systems and shared patterns to build coherent experiences. AI-assisted workflows and rapid prototyping help us explore ideas and test assumptions, with design judgment guiding how we use the results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You’ll Be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;em&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;textItalic&quot;&gt;Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt; role based in Lisbon. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;You will work from our &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Lisbon Hub&lt;/span&gt; a minimum of 2 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are only considering candidates who are already based in the &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Portugal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. As a result, &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;visa sponsorship and relocation support are not available for this position&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In Return&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be part of an enthusiastic, highly motivated team of &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;800+ Catawikians&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A competitive &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Annual Gross Base Salary&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;depending on your level, competencies, and overall experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Meal Allowance Card&lt;/span&gt; stipend per working day, in addition to salary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Health Insurance&lt;/span&gt; from day 1 (including dental coverage), with access to multiple hospitals and clinics and a vast wellness network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work From Home Allowance&lt;/span&gt; to help with your monthly household bills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Commuting&lt;/span&gt; between your home and our office is covered by Catawiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Office&lt;/span&gt; right in the centre of Lisbon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Sword, we’re building AI to heal billions and unlock humanity’s full potential. In doing so, we’re pioneering AI Care, a fundamentally new approach to healthcare built for medical reasoning, safety, and real-time treatment, not generic technology applied after the fact. As both a clinical-centric frontier AI lab and an applied AI platform, Sword is reimagining how care is delivered at scale, removing traditional barriers like appointments, waiting rooms, and stigma so more people can access the care they need—and ultimately get back to lives lived in full.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2020, Sword has expanded across physical therapy, women’s health, cardiometabolic, and mental health, and is now moving beyond the session to a fully AI-native, 24/7 care program that brings physical activity, therapeutic exercise, psychotherapy, nutrition, and behavior change into one connected experience. More than 700,000 members across three continents have completed over 10 million AI sessions, helping 1,000+ enterprise clients avoid more than $1 billion in unnecessary healthcare costs. Backed by 42 clinical studies, 44+ patents, and more than $500 million raised from leading investors including Khosla Ventures, General Catalyst, and Founders Fund, Sword is defining a new standard for healthcare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;AI&amp;nbsp;Proficiency at Sword&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI fluency is a core expectation at Sword. Every candidate is assessed against our three-level framework — be ready to share real examples of how AI is already part of how you work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explorer (Level 1) — Uses AI daily to boost personal productivity&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builder (Level 2) — Creates workflows and tools that elevate the whole team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrator (Level 3) — Embeds AI into products and processes at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every hire must demonstrate at least Level 1. The expected level will vary depending on the seniority of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;As an Expert Product Designer on the mobile team, you’ll own a critical part of the member experience: the native clinical product that delivers clinician-led AI care across a comprehensive, integrated care journey. This is an opportunity to make a meaningful impact and shape the future of care for millions of lives. Working closely with Product, Engineering, Design, AI, and Clinical teams, you&#39;ll be involved throughout the entire product development lifecycle, from feature discovery and definition to testing and release.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 5 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead user-centric research &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advocate for member needs at every stage of product development;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct research and analyze competitors to uncover insights and opportunities;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translate insights into product strategy and actionable design directions;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenge assumptions and proactively identify opportunities to improve the member experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; prototype solutions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end design process, from early discovery and concept exploration to high-quality execution;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Turn requirements into intuitive, visually engaging, and emotionally resonant experiences;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work in fast, iterative cycles to improve usability and drive retention;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Validate and refine designs through user testing, data, research, and feedback loops;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prototype and iterate rapidly, balancing speed, craft, and measurable impact;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive cross-functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Clinical, and other stakeholders to shape the future of our products;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive alignment across teams while constructively challenging decisions when needed;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure seamless design-to-development handoff and uphold quality in execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you need to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;3 3 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A genuine passion for creating products that meaningfully improve people’s health and quality of life;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;comment-mark&quot; data-comment-id=&quot;01a1f338-20af-768b-93f0-0745a9fc1394&quot;&gt;7+ years&lt;/span&gt; of product design experience, ideally within healthcare, technology, or other complex problem spaces;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating end-to-end design thinking, exceptional visual craft, thoughtful brand application, and attention to interaction details;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong product thinking, with the ability to balance member needs, business objectives, and technical constraints;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expert-level Figma skills and the ability to rapidly prototype, explore ideas, and support fast-paced experimentation and decision-making;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing native mobile applications and consumer-facing experiences (B2C or D2C);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with user research, usability testing, and data-informed design decisions;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong understanding of design systems and how to scale consistent, accessible, and high-quality experiences;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience designing AI-powered products, with an understanding of how to balance human and AI interactions to build trust and drive better outcomes;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A thoughtful approach to leveraging AI throughout the design process, knowing when it can accelerate your work and when human judgment and creativity matter most;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication and storytelling skills, with the ability to influence and collaborate effectively across multidisciplinary teams;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong sense of ownership, autonomy, and comfort navigating ambiguity in a fast-moving environment;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A naturally curious mindset, constantly questioning what works, what doesn’t, and why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;*The range below reflects base, variable, and equity for this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;This is a starting point, not a ceiling — once someone joins and proves they&#39;re outlier talent, we adjust quickly to make sure their compensation matches their impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Job titles may span more than one career level, so actual pay depends on skills, qualifications, experience, location, and market demand, among other factors. The range reflects base salary plus any variable, bonus, or sales incentives, and our estimate of the value of private company stock options where applicable. It&#39;s subject to change, and future stock value isn&#39;t guaranteed. Sword also offers additional benefits beyond total compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Total Compensation Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€49.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€77.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Country-specific benefits may vary and will be detailed separately.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;sup&gt;Sword Health complies with applicable Federal and State civil rights laws and does not discriminate on the basis of Age, Ancestry, Color, Citizenship, Gender, Gender expression, Gender identity, Gender information, Marital status, Medical condition, National origin, Physical or mental disability, Pregnancy, Race, Religion, Caste, Sexual orientation, and Veteran status.&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced Product Designer to help shape key areas of the member experience as the Tide app continues to evolve across 55+ products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we approach design with a relentless focus on our members. We love turning the complexity of a chaotic financial world into simple, beautiful and scalable experiences that make running a business easier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll take ownership of design across high-impact products, working within dedicated cross-functional teams. You’ll have significant autonomy to shape the direction of your work, partnering closely with Product and Engineering to balance exceptional member experiences with technical, regulatory and commercial considerations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re open to designers operating at Senior, Senior II or Lead level. What matters most is the strength of your craft, the quality of your thinking, your ability to navigate complexity and the impact you’ve had on the products you’ve helped build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you enjoy solving difficult problems, thinking in systems and creating thoughtful experiences that make a genuine difference to small businesses, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own End-to-End Product Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Take ownership of complex product challenges, from early discovery and problem definition through to detailed design and delivery. Create intuitive, engaging experiences that simplify the way our members run their businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape Product Direction: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, Data and Operations to understand customer and business needs, challenge assumptions and influence product priorities. Bring a strong design perspective to product strategy, not just execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for Scale and Simplicity: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate complex technical requirements, workflows and regulatory constraints into clear, elegant and scalable experiences. Think beyond individual screens to create cohesive journeys across iOS, Android and web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use Research and Data to Drive Decisions: &lt;/strong&gt;Combine qualitative research, quantitative insights, experimentation and product metrics to understand problems, validate solutions and continuously improve the member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a High Bar for Craft: &lt;/strong&gt;Deliver exceptional interaction and visual design, with a sharp eye for typography, layout, usability and detail. Contribute to the evolution of Tide’s cross-platform design system and ensure consistency without compromising innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence and Elevate Design Quality: &lt;/strong&gt;Bring clarity to ambiguous challenges, communicate your thinking effectively and collaborate constructively with stakeholders. Share knowledge, provide thoughtful feedback and help raise the quality of design across the wider team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional Product Design Craft: &lt;/strong&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating high-quality, end-to-end product design work, including complex digital products, workflows or systems. We’re interested in the problems you’ve solved, the decisions you’ve made and the outcomes you’ve influenced, rather than a specific number of years of experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Systems Thinking: &lt;/strong&gt;The ability to think holistically about products, user journeys and interconnected experiences rather than isolated features or screens. You understand how design decisions scale across platforms, markets and technical or regulatory constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Thinking and Commercial Awareness: &lt;/strong&gt;You connect customer needs with business objectives and understand how good design contributes to meaningful product outcomes. You’re comfortable using evidence to inform decisions and making thoughtful trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration and Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;A proven ability to work effectively within cross-functional teams, build strong relationships and constructively challenge assumptions. You can communicate complex design decisions clearly and bring others along with your thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced Interaction and Visual Design: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong proficiency in Figma, prototyping and modern design systems, combined with an excellent understanding of interaction patterns, accessibility and the technical implications of your decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy and Comfort with Ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;You’re confident taking ownership of complex challenges, identifying the right problems to solve and creating clarity where requirements aren’t always fully defined. You know when to move independently and when to bring others into the conversation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathy and Curiosity: &lt;/strong&gt;You care deeply about understanding the people you’re designing for and are motivated by making their lives easier. You’re curious, open to feedback and continuously looking for ways to improve your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI and Future-Focused Thinking: &lt;/strong&gt;You’re curious about how AI is changing the way products are designed and experienced. You’re interested in experimenting with emerging tools, evolving your workflows and exploring how new technologies can create meaningful value for members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re more interested in your capabilities, judgement and impact than your previous job title or the number of years you’ve spent in design. Experience in fintech or other complex, regulated environments is valuable, but not essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation – competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Paid maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Private family insurance with additional OPD coverage and top-up options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Cover – Comprehensive accidental and life insurance protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it&#39;s time for a replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; Meals – Office perks with snacks, coffee, tea, and lunch (location dependent).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;TIDEAN WAYS OF WORKING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we champion a &lt;strong&gt;flexible workplace &lt;/strong&gt;model that&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;supports both in-person and remote work to cater to the specific needs of our different teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While remote work is supported, we believe in the power of face-to-face interactions to foster team spirit and collaboration. Our offices are designed as hubs for innovation and team-building, where we encourage regular in-person gatherings to foster a strong sense of community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-NZ1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@tide.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;talent@tide.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is one app with many products for small businesses: business accounts, payments, credit, insurance, invoicing, accounting and more. Over 2 million members across the UK, India, Germany and France use it to run their businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Product Design team designs every part of that experience. Designers work inside cross-functional teams alongside Product Managers, Engineers, UX Writers and Researchers, and we encourage designers to move between teams so they keep learning and growing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re at an exciting point. Under our new design structure, we’re raising the bar on craft, making the whole app feel like one connected experience, and building a stronger design community. We’re also building a senior individual contributor track in design for the first time. This role is one of the first, so you’ll help define what design looks like at Tide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Staff Product Designer, you’ll work on our most complex and high-visibility problems. You’ll report directly to the Head of Design and work across teams rather than sitting in one, moving to wherever the biggest design challenge is.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projects include continuing to evolve our AI solutions, helping shape the next phase of our app architecture and taking lead on new 0 to 1 initiatives. You will also help actively raise the quality bar across the entire design organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re open to designers operating at Senior-Staff or Principal level. Titles vary across companies, so what matters most is the strength of your craft, the quality of your thinking, and the impact you’ve had.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As Senior Staff Product Designer, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead multiple projects end to end.&lt;/strong&gt; Go from early discovery and concepts to prototyping, testing and handover to engineering, working hands-on in Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the experience strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product and Engineering leaders to turn messy, ambiguous problems into a clear design vision, priorities and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect the app.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with design leads across Tide to create shared patterns and foundations, as Tide app continues to evolve across 55+ products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the craft bar.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the example for quality, mentor other designers, and introduce better ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer AI.&lt;/strong&gt; Shape how AI shows up in our product, and how we use AI in our own design process, from ideas to code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure and iterate.&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, learn from real member behaviour, and improve. You’d rather launch, learn and refine than wait for perfection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years in product design, with experience operating at Staff level or above (or equivalent scope) in a SaaS, fintech or scale-up environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record designing intuitive mobile &amp;amp; web experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-team work, such as a product or platform redesign or new 0-to-1 product and iterations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level craft across the full product lifecycle: from early discovery, research, and concepting to prototyping, validation, and design-to-code handover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinking: you design across features and touchpoints, not just single screens&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business acumen: you balance member needs with commercial goals, and speed with quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity and change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with senior leaders. You can present, shape, defend and adapt your ideas with VPs and SVPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open, collaborative style: you enjoy discussing work in the open, being challenged, and working closely with Product Managers and Engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET IN RETURN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our location-specific employee benefits are designed to cater to the unique needs of Tideans:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Compensation –&amp;nbsp; Competitive salary and share options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time Off – Generous annual leave on top of bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parental Leave – Paid maternity, paternity, and adoption leave to support your family journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sabbatical – Extended unpaid and paid leave options after completing milestone years with Tide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to salary sacrifice benefits – like Nursery (could save up to 47% on fees!) and Cycle to Work discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Insurance – Comprehensive Private family insurance plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Cover – Comprehensive accidental and life insurance protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Wellbeing – Access to therapy sessions, courses, meditations, and workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning – Build your retirement fund faster with Tide’s pension scheme on eligible earnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering &amp;amp; Development Days – Paid days annually for volunteering or personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development – Annual budget for books, courses, coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WOO (Work Outside the Office) – Work from abroad for up to 90 days annually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Setup – Contribution towards setting up your home office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Laptop Ownership – Keep your old laptop and get a new one when it’s time for a replacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks &amp;amp; Meals – Daily breakfast spread with all-day coffee, tea, and juices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:talent@tide.co&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;talent@tide.co&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mentimeter is an engagement company with a simple goal: to make every leader better. Through interaction, insights and recommendations, its platform helps organizations turn participation into better understanding and stronger performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in Stockholm in 2012, Mentimeter is used by 20 million people each month across 1.3 million organizations. At Mentimeter, we believe better leadership starts with listening and that the strongest results are achieved together. That’s why we foster a culture built on curiosity, collaboration and shared ownership. By joining us, you’ll help leaders turn participation into deeper understanding and stronger performance, advancing our ambition to help more than one billion people listen, learn and work better together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer at Mentimeter, you own the experience your team ships and how it fits into the whole: making sure it works, solves a problem people actually have, and holds together as we build more. Millions of leaders use Mentimeter to lead: to make a decision, bring people with them, understand what their organisation actually thinks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You join at the point where the work gets hardest and most interesting. Mentimeter has grown from one tool into an engagement suite, and making those pieces feel like one experience leaders and organisations can build on is now one of our hardest problems. The payoff is turning a great moment of engagement into results people act on, insight that holds over time, and value that spreads across an organisation, powered by AI that helps leaders see what matters and act on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the Design Director for that area and work day to day inside a product team, alongside a Product Manager and Product Engineers. Beyond the team, you’ll work with other competences such as User Research, Analytics, Content Design, Accessibility, Design Systems, Marketing and Sales to understand users and keep the suite coherent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end experiences across the full development model, from problem framing through shipped and refined iteration: interaction, visual design, usability, prototyping and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take an ambiguous problem and leave the room with a clear problem statement, hypotheses and success criteria you can evaluate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground direction in user evidence. Spend real time with users, read the signal, and read the release data afterwards to know whether anything actually changed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Name the trade-offs between user value, usability, coherence and technical constraint instead of letting them sit implicit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design patterns that scale across surfaces and teams, and protect product-wide coherence as the suite grows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the experience, not the handoff. You work from the problem through to what shipped and what it changed, and you treat &quot;did this work for the user?&quot; as part of your job, not someone else&#39;s follow-up. You can hold a strong design opinion without needing to win the room, and you’d rather get to the right solution to the right problem than polish the wrong one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You work through AI as part of how you design, not a tool you reach for occasionally. You use it across research, exploration and execution, you read its output critically rather than ship it, and you hold a real view of where it strengthens the work and where it degrades the experience. Autocomplete is not what we mean.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You treat insight and data as design material, not reporting. You&#39;re comfortable close to users and close to the numbers, and you bring the team closer to both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;This role might not be for you if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI only as autocomplete, or steer clear of it, rather than making it part of how you design and solve problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want the problem handed to you fully framed, with the user need and success criteria already decided.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You see design as what happens after the real decisions are made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You treat research and data as someone else&#39;s job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You consider the work done when the design ships, rather than when you know whether it changed something for users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to stay in visual polish and avoid the ambiguity of early product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio that shows end-to-end product design: problem framing, interaction and visual craft, and shipped outcomes, not only final screens.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence that you ground design in user research and data, and change direction based on what you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI built into how you already work, across research, exploration and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product thinking: you frame design decisions in terms of user value, business impact and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems awareness: you design patterns that hold across surfaces and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, and comfort working independently and in a cross-functional team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don&#39;t have to know Swedish. Daily work is carried out in English and the Mentimeter team currently boasts over 50 nationalities!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is primarily an on-site role at Mentimeter HQ in Stockholm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Compensation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe in fair and transparent compensation that grows with you. The salary range for this role is SEK 65,000–SEK 82,000 per month. It’s intentionally broad to reflect the different stages of growth within the role: from early development to deep expertise and meaningful impact.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Where an individual is placed within the range depends on factors such as relevant experience, demonstrated skills, and alignment with the role’s requirements. We’re committed to supporting your growth. You’ll have ongoing development conversations with your manager, and your salary will evolve as you build skills and contribute to our mission.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;In addition to your monthly salary, we offer a comprehensive benefits package—learn more about it here: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits/stockholm&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Mentimeter can offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we can offer a diverse and inclusive work environment supported by smart and driven colleagues. We believe in continuous professional development for all of our colleagues and therefore offer access to a leadership program (including external personal coach) and relevant education to ensure that we continue to be state-of-the-art when it comes to innovating and building Mentimeter. Your place will be in a growing company with lots of career opportunities, working on a beloved product used by more than 300 million people. It’s not all about work though, we also offer a very healthy view on work-life balance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of this comes attached with a competitive compensation and benefits package, including pension contributions. Learn more about our benefits by visiting our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/benefits&quot;&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;AI and Hiring at Mentimeter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Mentimeter, we believe AI helps us work smarter - but it never replaces the human assessment, curiosity, and personal connection that define our culture and our hiring. We use AI as a sparring partner: to bounce ideas, bring new perspectives, support structure, and make our work more efficient. But the meaning, decisions, and interactions always come from people.&amp;nbsp;AI strengthens our work, but it does not define it. At Mentimeter, we’re not building an AI-driven hiring process - we’re building a people-first culture, where technology helps us listen, learn, and grow together.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture at Mentimeter&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Mentimeter we believe in giving everyone a voice - regardless of who you are. So we build a platform that does just that. Our platform is not only our product but also our organization. A platform where people feel safe, where differences are embraced, a place where you can have fun. We strongly encourage applicants who are people of color, LGBTQ+, women, people with disabilities, and/or formerly incarcerated people, and a college degree is not strictly required. In order to give everyone a voice, we need to be as diverse as our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about our culture by visiting our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/culture&quot;&gt;Culture page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;Review our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mentimeter.com/trust/legal/candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
